messages.reasoning:
I see the issue. The original structure was:
```
#[pymethods]
impl RiskGate {
    // pub fn new, evaluate, set_trading_state, ... all at 4-space indent
}
```

My patch accidentally introduced:
```
#[pymethods]
impl RiskGate {
    // evaluate at 8-space indent (was 4 spaces + proper)
    // all private helpers inside an extra impl RiskGate block, also at extra indent
    // THEN set_trading_state at 4-space indent (original)
    // AND there's also the old closing brace issues
}
```

